{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b6f7368d356cfaab85fcd0d35424c2c765b79ecbe68e0980053b3c863b69f1a6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_a:2_4_007_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:572365aea966b2f60f5b7814c28d98283e2e44269da8c7f12fc9ec5797c46031",
      "text": "制作人。现在方便说话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_a:2_4_007_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2fac899ee3d235e2f9bbea82dd2727d7ecdc355bedfd963d519d61bce20856b",
      "text": "刚才电视里传来的旋律，\n让我有点在意呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_a:2_4_007_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df37af35f25c7ed701a60fe060acf2b1e02b502d4f3b935ea233e14279a5cb32",
      "text": "正在想是在哪里听过的呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_a:2_4_007_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85d6d78cef0a4545e84de05b2850228ff9814651aeb7138145e79f76ff97b305",
      "text": "想起来是之前在圣诞约会的录制中唱诗班唱过的\n曲子，就想跟你聊聊了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_a:2_4_007_01_09_a:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8933c5a1fdd28af82446c9cf772ab55c43b2c707e219adc57469c52f96a3f99c",
      "text": "歌声很美呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_a:2_4_007_01_09_a:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0553ed8b9760cf3f7bc177bfcea06680a4aa97a838ed023a07ddea75189d1f2f",
      "text": "您当时非常\n中意呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_a:2_4_007_01_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ae56393b09c13f6ecb0c0d922700245ca0b583905ca9c3154cbde6e53dbb959",
      "text": "嗯。清澈透明的声音层层重叠，\n让人想要一直听下去呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_a:2_4_007_01_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcdfa2be68a7e447271c5a171cb2e4738d95569e26ad7035a3c158b2c162b24a",
      "text": "当时大家还一起稍微欣赏了一下音乐会呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_a:2_4_007_01_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35936ad26f0fb0d7fb348ef91b9a1725b2bf2275b1e28358f51a6a3b9f22fbae",
      "text": "享介先生和朱雀先生他们听得入迷的样子，\n让人印象深刻啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_a:2_4_007_01_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08fd7e90f7aeecea5799f2978763c43d2b0e5a930845bb5f0c43ea84d3dd6c6a",
      "text": "每个人的感受方式也各不相同，很有意思。就像约会的编排、\n还有我们的歌曲一样，都各有特色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_a:2_4_007_01_09_a:cmd-000026:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0376d715a8dbfcf77a11a43e3037158479d9c740a003f24f42e3e9b994d4e28d",
      "text": "您观察得很仔细呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_a:2_4_007_01_09_a:cmd-000027:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd260560ac646763752290ec8ccd0e585b06cb4fc4117b6646062d24f53a41f7",
      "text": "原来您一直在守护着\n大家啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_a:2_4_007_01_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4c728d7f5c0c474d9ad2d740a27e1d16c1d97125173dbc2c74c33fcee0cea58",
      "text": "呵呵。如果只是看着的话，我也能做到嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_a:2_4_007_01_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:542e94ba51e8650fd4ef817500731943c47bfeac7ff03ba18bb8dd4e8851ab3f",
      "text": "就像这样，每一段音乐中都会叠加上\n新的回忆呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:007kei_401_2_4_007_01_09_a:2_4_007_01_09_a:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a9e6e743c435e5b2102f1c0ac9d79b4f914dd273225ea5514a1e6e83eb6b09a",
      "text": "……谢谢你听我说这些，制作人。\n等我又想起什么了再打给你。再见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
